char *off_138FE4[2] =
{
  "Kr\xA2lowa rozgoryczona tym ma\x92\xA7e\xA4stwem postanowi\x92a powr\xA2ci\x8D za morze do swego ojczystego kr\xA2lestwa. Nie chcia\x92a d\x92u\xA7ej dzieli\x8D \x92o\xA7a z takim skner\x86 jak TY!",
  "The Queen, utterly dissatisfied with the marriage, decided to leave you. She did not want to share the bed with a miser like you."
}; // weak
char *off_138FF0[2] =
{
  "Kr\xA2lowa w napadzie furi spakowa\x92a kufry i odp\x92yn\x91\x92a statkiem za morze. \xA1eby jednak zado\x9E\x8D uczyni\x8D wszystkim swoim krzywdom wdar\x92a si\x91 do skarbca na %s zabieraj\x86c ca\x92e z\x92oto.",
  "In the act of fury the Queen packed her boxes and left on a ship. Before doing so she took all jewellery and gold with her from the castle of %s"
}; // weak
char *off_138FFC[2] =
{
  "Twa ma\x92\xA7onka mia\x92a dosy\x8D takiego traktowania. Opuszczaj\x86c Twe w\x92o\x9Eci wla\x92a trucizn\x91 do studni na zamku %s, by odwdzi\x91czy\x8D si\x91 pi\x91knym za nadobne. Tamtejsi  ch\x92opi cierpi\x86 teraz okrutne m\x91czarnie i wymieraj\x86 masowo",
  "Your wife would not stand this kind of negligence from you. Before parting she spilt poison into the well in the castle of %s. Farmers suffer and die in pain."
}; // weak
char *off_139008[2] =
{
  "Twa ma\x92\xA7onka mia\x92a po dziurki w nosie Twej postawy. Kaza\x92a spakowa\x8D swe szaty i odp\x92yn\x91\x92a do ojca. Aby zem\x9Eci\x8D si\x91 na Tobie rozkaza\x92a s\x92ugom podpali\x8D zamek %s.",
  "Your wife, before parting, ordered her servants to set the castle of %s on fire."
}; // weak
__int16 word_139014[] = { 30 }; // weak
char *off_139016[2] =
{
  "O panie  m\xA2j! Nudz\x91 si\x91... my\x9El\x91, i\xA7 wielkie polowanie rozweseli moje serce.",
  "My dearest one, I am so bored. I think I would fancy a big hunting trip."
}; // weak
char *off_139174[2] =
{
  "Panie, kr\xA2lowa urodzi\x92a Ci syna!!!! Nadworni m\x91drcy i weterani Twoich najwi\x91kszych bitew w szybkim tempie zbroj\x86 go w wiedz\x91 i kszta\x92c\x86 w rzemio\x9Ele wojennym, po to by m\xA2g\x92 s\x92u\xA7y\x8D Ci jako oddany dow\xA2dca.",
  "Master, the Queen gave birth to your son!!! Your best scholars and knights train him in warcraft so that he can be your right hand soon."
}; // weak
char *off_139180[2] =
{
  "Kr\xA2lu!!! Twa \xA7ona pocz\x91\x92a c\xA2rk\x91. Nasi m\x91drcy orzekli, \xA7e odziedziczony po ojcu temperament i zaci\x91to\x9E\x8D matki spowoduj\x86, \xA7e b\x91dzie ona wspania\x92ym dow\xA2dc\x86 Twych wojsk.",
  "Master. Your wife has given birth to your daughter. Scholars say that she has inherited your strength of character and your temperament. Soon she will become a great officer of your troops."
}; // weak
